# ============================================================================
# Port kits — donor-derived source, never committed (user ruling 2026-08-02).
#
# These hold machine-decompiled donor actor code (m2c output from split asm)
# used as porting aids. They pass the exe greplist gate because docs/ is exempt,
# but they are donor CODE rather than analysis, and the covenant keeps donor
# content out of the repo — the same call already made for the raw DuskTap
# capture traces. Keep them local; the project's own ported implementations
# live in src/ and are committed normally.
# ============================================================================
docs/WW Linked/port-kits/

# Local-only captured diagnostic dumps (preserved for reference, never commit)
Diagnostic files/

